{"id":"047c158d-970d-4774-8093-f6629c47ffd6","expr":"(!trimWhiteSpace) || (result.length() <= value.length())","rationale":"If trimWhiteSpace is true, the returned string is a trimmed or quoted substring of the original value, so length is less or equal; if false, it may be same or longer due to escaping.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.internal.StringUtil#escapeCsv(CharSequence,boolean):CharSequence","file":"io/netty/util/internal/StringUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:15:19.643524197Z"}
