{"id":"d69a6c97-57e4-493f-a604-2d2cbfe9bebe","expr":"ipAddressString.length() > 0","rationale":"Because a valid IP address string is meaningful only if it has positive length; empty or zero length string is not valid IP.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#createByteArrayFromIpAddressString(String):byte[]","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:07.473240934Z"}
{"id":"bd5a6208-da0b-4ad8-a96f-0dbb9822c48b","expr":"ipAddressString.indexOf('%') >= -1","rationale":"Always true so boring, discard.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#createByteArrayFromIpAddressString(String):byte[]","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:07.473240934Z"}
{"id":"f440e462-23d4-474b-8bd1-9924220b9895","expr":"ipAddressString.length() >= 0","rationale":"Trivial, discard.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#createByteArrayFromIpAddressString(String):byte[]","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:07.473240934Z"}
{"id":"fb88b435-63f3-4737-984e-f9cd5f5e446c","expr":"result == null || result.getHostAddress().equals(ipAddressString)","rationale":"The method converts an IP string to InetAddress; if result is non-null, its string form equals or corresponds to the input IP string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#createInetAddressFromIpAddressString(String):InetAddress","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:07.569255107Z"}
{"id":"a44db92f-277f-4946-b511-16aeb78c6876","expr":"ipAddressString != null","rationale":"The input string ipAddressString must not be null for the method to attempt validation or address creation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#createInetAddressFromIpAddressString(String):InetAddress","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:07.694965585Z"}
{"id":"809b59cc-3acf-44c0-84bc-aa5e625f2b25","expr":"ipAddressString.length() > 0","rationale":"For ipAddressString to be considered valid, it has to be non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#createInetAddressFromIpAddressString(String):InetAddress","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:07.694965585Z"}
{"id":"02859e25-b73c-4f56-8029-7dfcd6b24469","expr":"(result == null) || (result.length == 4 || result.length == 16)","rationale":"The method returns a byte array representing an IP address; IPv4 addresses have 4 bytes and IPv6 addresses have 16 bytes, or null if invalid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#createByteArrayFromIpAddressString(String):byte[]","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:09.510695760Z"}
