{"id":"3bfc7db2-f92f-4c3c-a924-18b2e3127b35","expr":"(result == null) || (result.length > 0)","rationale":"When the method returns a non-null byte array, it is never empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#createByteArrayFromIpAddressString(String):byte[]","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:09.510695760Z"}
{"id":"c29f8833-f065-4ebf-8ddb-4b562c315b16","expr":"ip != null","rationale":"The method accesses ip with decimalDigit, so ip must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#ipv4WordToByte(String,int,int):byte","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:11.883514593Z"}
{"id":"42562c84-b883-48ee-a2f8-65fe22fa0820","expr":"from >= 0","rationale":"The 'from' index should be valid as it is used to access characters in ip.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#ipv4WordToByte(String,int,int):byte","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:11.883514593Z"}
{"id":"a2957567-f781-4372-bc4d-54039f27a19d","expr":"toExclusive > from","rationale":"Since the method indexes from up to toExclusive-1, toExclusive must be greater than from.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#ipv4WordToByte(String,int,int):byte","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:11.883514593Z"}
{"id":"6045207d-e137-4a09-9fea-4fe0f32c3272","expr":"toExclusive <= ip.length()","rationale":"toExclusive is the exclusive upper bound of the substring of ip, so must not be beyond ip length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#ipv4WordToByte(String,int,int):byte","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:11.883514593Z"}
{"id":"d90867a1-616a-4a17-b9a7-cf0f6fc3bb0a","expr":"from < toExclusive","rationale":"The method requires at least one character between from and toExclusive to parse.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#ipv4WordToByte(String,int,int):byte","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:11.883514593Z"}
{"id":"0cd716b3-8018-495b-aafc-dde821db4d35","expr":"str != null","rationale":"The method uses str.charAt(pos), so str must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#decimalDigit(String,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:11.914106807Z"}
{"id":"f0bdf0ab-859b-47aa-8d25-fbe469ec8086","expr":"pos >= 0","rationale":"Index for charAt must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#decimalDigit(String,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:11.914106807Z"}
{"id":"294ffcf5-adb6-4bd8-b631-258b42601d59","expr":"pos < str.length()","rationale":"Index for charAt must be strictly less than string length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#decimalDigit(String,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:11.914106807Z"}
{"id":"32e99e04-a9d4-4d56-93e0-cd3c8380e536","expr":"Character.isDigit(str.charAt(pos))","rationale":"The method calculates decimal digit value, so the character at pos should be numeric.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#decimalDigit(String,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:11.914106807Z"}
{"id":"f5bda917-5358-46ca-9371-3c21d9655230","expr":"str.length() > 0","rationale":"pos is an index in the string, so string must not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#decimalDigit(String,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:11.914106807Z"}
{"id":"31f35d55-f1ca-4546-8042-8d01b34a6d1e","expr":"result == str.charAt(pos) - '0'","rationale":"By the method implementation, the returned integer is the digit value of str.charAt(pos).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#decimalDigit(String,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:12.882811994Z"}
{"id":"5998b549-9d01-44f0-960e-a552b2875247","expr":"result >= 0 && result <= 9","rationale":"The subtraction of '0' from a digit character results in a value in 0 to 9.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#decimalDigit(String,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:12.882811994Z"}
{"id":"3a8ca9d5-b369-4584-b9b1-25fcaf9d7134","expr":"result >= 0 && result <= 255","rationale":"The byte result corresponds to one octet of an IPv4 address, which is in [0,255] range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#ipv4WordToByte(String,int,int):byte","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:14.439955471Z"}
{"id":"82916295-d085-4e23-a796-c4691d532c00","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Ensures the result byte array is not null upon method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#validIpV4ToBytes(String):byte[]","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:16.762361026Z"}
{"id":"fa7b1e74-c966-4a64-a649-4b122fbf28b0","expr":"result.length == 4","rationale":"The resulting byte array must be exactly length 4 because IPv4 address is composed of 4 bytes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#validIpV4ToBytes(String):byte[]","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:16.762361026Z"}
{"id":"451fca28-f3f6-448b-9a15-8875f00e5fbd","expr":"!(result[0] < 0 || result[1] < 0 || result[2] < 0 || result[3] < 0)","rationale":"All bytes in result represent positive octets of an IPv4 address in range 0 to 255 inclusive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#validIpV4ToBytes(String):byte[]","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:16.762361026Z"}
{"id":"ddd331bf-4b98-436d-833d-17faa22663e0","expr":"ip != null","rationale":"The parameter ip must be non-null to call methods like indexOf and to extract substrings without NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#validIpV4ToBytes(String):byte[]","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:18.447252373Z"}
{"id":"5ee0c8de-95ed-49e0-8fb3-b34b6bb35f85","expr":"ip.indexOf('.', 1) >= 0","rationale":"The ip string must contain a dot character after position 1 for the method logic to find the separate IPv4 octets.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#validIpV4ToBytes(String):byte[]","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:18.447252373Z"}
{"id":"f2e2f240-4916-43f4-9ad9-c470d94ae86e","expr":"ip.length() >= 7","rationale":"The minimum length of an IPv4 address string in dotted decimal notation is 7 characters (e.g. '0.0.0.0').","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#validIpV4ToBytes(String):byte[]","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:18.447252373Z"}
{"id":"758d86bc-6342-4730-b20a-035e4c2900bd","expr":"ip.indexOf('.') < ip.length() - 1","rationale":"There must be a dot character in ip that is not the last character to parse the last IPv4 octet properly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#validIpV4ToBytes(String):byte[]","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:18.447252373Z"}
{"id":"09e5e289-1769-4449-b69a-22381eb95b0e","expr":"ip.indexOf('.', ip.indexOf('.') + 1) >= 0","rationale":"There must be multiple dots present in the ip string to separate the four IPv4 octets.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#validIpV4ToBytes(String):byte[]","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:18.447252373Z"}
{"id":"3af34d9f-29ea-4ba5-8c1e-83799120e7e9","expr":"ipAddress != null","rationale":"The method expects a non-null Inet4Address to function correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#ipv4AddressToInt(Inet4Address):int","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:19.625690850Z"}
{"id":"da674e51-5e35-4274-87b1-5d58b025960a","expr":"ipAddress.getAddress().length == 4","rationale":"Inet4Address.getAddress() returns a 4-element byte array for a valid IPv4 address.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#ipv4AddressToInt(Inet4Address):int","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:19.625690850Z"}
{"id":"edbd78bd-80b0-419c-b9ed-94ab5ee74ef8","expr":"(i >>> 24) >= 0 && (i >>> 24) <= 255","rationale":"The highest byte after shifting and masking will always be between 0 and 255.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#intToIpAddress(int):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:20.958871216Z"}
{"id":"cae9af85-091e-4b3a-b63c-a7bcc5bebe80","expr":"(i >>> 16 & 0xff) >= 0 && (i >>> 16 & 0xff) <= 255","rationale":"The second highest byte after shifting and masking is a 8-bit unsigned value from 0 to 255.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#intToIpAddress(int):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:20.958871216Z"}
{"id":"718df645-8524-4445-b807-082bdebc0676","expr":"(i >>> 8 & 0xff) >= 0 && (i >>> 8 & 0xff) <= 255","rationale":"The third byte after shifting and masking is a 8-bit unsigned integer between 0 and 255.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#intToIpAddress(int):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:20.958871216Z"}
{"id":"b308e47d-35e6-46f5-a41d-54ceb5f2f6b2","expr":"(i & 0xff) >= 0 && (i & 0xff) <= 255","rationale":"The lowest byte after masking is always in 0 to 255.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#intToIpAddress(int):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:20.958871216Z"}
{"id":"03ea027e-1d05-4278-a7e6-706931975e9e","expr":"result >= 0 && (result & 0xFFFFFFFF) == result","rationale":"The result is the 32-bit integer representing the IPv4 address, which is always between 0 and the max unsigned 32-bit int (masked with 0xFFFFFFFF).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#ipv4AddressToInt(Inet4Address):int","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:21.889746160Z"}
{"id":"fc459bf9-449b-42fe-bbad-8f7c77e55708","expr":"(result >>> 24) == (ipAddress.getAddress()[0] & 0xFF)","rationale":"The first octet from ipAddress's byte array is shifted into the top 8 bits of the result int.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#ipv4AddressToInt(Inet4Address):int","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:21.889746160Z"}
{"id":"7047daaa-ca11-4f99-94fb-96138568293a","expr":"((result >>> 8) & 0xFF) == (ipAddress.getAddress()[2] & 0xFF)","rationale":"The third octet in the IPv4 address corresponds to bits 8-15 of the result. This invariant reflects the bitwise packing.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#ipv4AddressToInt(Inet4Address):int","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:21.889746160Z"}
{"id":"8e40bb42-feb6-4af3-b979-3758a5eb8845","expr":"bytes != null","rationale":"The method converts a byte array to IP address string; bytes should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#bytesToIpAddress(byte[]):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:22.609908959Z"}
{"id":"c4882b09-62dd-4a4f-95fb-f5b4c37effbb","expr":"bytes.length == 4 || bytes.length == 16","rationale":"The byte array must be either 4 or 16 bytes long for valid IPv4 or IPv6 address.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#bytesToIpAddress(byte[]):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:22.609908959Z"}
{"id":"beb3c884-a36c-4ef9-b92a-926c1a523252","expr":"bytes.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#bytesToIpAddress(byte[]):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:22.609908959Z"}
{"id":"390e6c4e-6224-452b-b6ef-42c6b44cf91e","expr":"bytes.length != 0","rationale":"Empty byte array is not a valid IP address representation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#bytesToIpAddress(byte[]):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:22.609908959Z"}
{"id":"4c622007-dbb2-44c6-9411-0a9091a61977","expr":"! (bytes.length != 4 && bytes.length != 16)","rationale":"Ensures the length is either 4 or 16 bytes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#bytesToIpAddress(byte[]):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:22.609908959Z"}
{"id":"a7408254-0f44-4625-9ca8-e9bcb774a139","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a string representation of the IP address, so result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#intToIpAddress(int):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:23.013118385Z"}
{"id":"604027f1-69c0-4b7d-8cb9-2fc2aaf38007","expr":"result.equals((i >> 24 & 0xff) + \".\" + (i >> 16 & 0xff) + \".\" + (i >> 8 & 0xff) + \".\" + (i & 0xff))","rationale":"The result string is constructed by extracting 4 octets from the integer and joining them with dots.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#intToIpAddress(int):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:23.013118385Z"}
{"id":"3b27ae2c-fc6d-4009-94e0-d6bfe2d374bc","expr":"!result.startsWith(\".\") && !result.endsWith(\".\")","rationale":"The result string should not start or end with a dot, maintaining valid IPv4 format.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#intToIpAddress(int):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:23.013118385Z"}
{"id":"3d71c04c-01e1-4756-a235-5b53f9fbc2f1","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a string representing the IP address, which should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#bytesToIpAddress(byte[]):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:25.077648213Z"}
{"id":"a6a3bdcd-4cdf-42d1-9aef-caf82d544612","expr":"(bytes.length == 4) == (result.indexOf(':') == -1)","rationale":"If input is IPv4 length, the resulting string is IPv4 format without colons; otherwise IPv6 contains colons.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#bytesToIpAddress(byte[]):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:25.077648213Z"}
{"id":"47a20ff9-185a-43e6-8746-80c5111e20ce","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"A valid IP address string should not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#bytesToIpAddress(byte[]):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:25.077648213Z"}
{"id":"65818fdd-892e-4155-ad96-73af60c48392","expr":"bytes != null","rationale":"The method accesses bytes[offset], so bytes must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#bytesToIpAddress(byte[],int,int):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:26.144368315Z"}
{"id":"cdd3c0ed-47f2-4cac-8723-fa49281fc80e","expr":"offset >= 0","rationale":"Offset is used as an index into the bytes array and must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#bytesToIpAddress(byte[],int,int):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:26.144368315Z"}
{"id":"8d5c634c-cfe7-4624-9158-af0cc684bc41","expr":"(length == 4 || length == 16)","rationale":"The method only accepts lengths of 4 or 16 for IPv4 or IPv6 addresses.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#bytesToIpAddress(byte[],int,int):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:26.144368315Z"}
{"id":"e419eb21-0c5a-4109-a1e4-5e1abec232da","expr":"(offset + length) <= bytes.length","rationale":"Ensures the offset and length define a valid slice within the bytes array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#bytesToIpAddress(byte[],int,int):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:26.144368315Z"}
{"id":"dbb50626-5e1f-40aa-9486-050471031751","expr":"length > 0","rationale":"Length must be positive for meaningful IP address conversion.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#bytesToIpAddress(byte[],int,int):String","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:26.144368315Z"}
{"id":"04da1898-42bf-470d-82a1-abb403c34740","expr":"ip != null","rationale":"IP must be non-null to check validity and avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#isValidIpV6Address(String):boolean","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:26.291621974Z"}
{"id":"75c0d3a2-84fe-43d4-8865-0ab052ae3171","expr":"ip.length() >= 2","rationale":"IPv6 addresses have at least two characters, e.g., '::'.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#isValidIpV6Address(String):boolean","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:26.291621974Z"}
{"id":"5a61118e-49ac-4419-a1db-c93ff14f722d","expr":"ip.indexOf(':') >= 0","rationale":"IPv6 addresses must contain at least one colon separator.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.NetUtil#isValidIpV6Address(String):boolean","file":"io/netty/util/NetUtil.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T09:35:26.291621974Z"}
